- ORAL TREPONEME ENRICHMENT BROTH (OTEB)

- Products: AS-603 Oral Treponeme Enrichment Broth (OTEB) 10 tubes / pkg"},{"step":"Intended Use: OTEB is an enriched medium for the isolation, cultivation and maintenance of Treponemes found as part of the oral flora."},{"step":"OTEB is a complex peptone-yeast extract medium containing volatile fatty acids and serum for a source of long chain fatty acids. Volatile fatty acids and serum are necessary nutrients for recovery of Treponemes from the oral flora. Inoculation of the medium can be done using a gassing cannula or inside an anaerobic chamber. This medium is prepared, stored and dispensed under oxygen-free conditions to prevent the formation of oxidized products prior to use."},{"step":"Final pH 7.0 +/- 0.2 at 25 degrees C."},{"step":"Final volume 7.0 ml +/- 0.7."}],"volume":1000}}
